# Comic Endpoints
###
# 1. Create a new comic
POST http://localhost:3000/api/comics/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "TGHKA",
    "chapter": "1",
    "page": "1"
}

###

# 1.1 Create a new comic with link
POST http://localhost:3000/api/comics/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "TGHKA",
    "chapter": "1",
    "page": "1",
    "link": "https://example.com"
}

###

# 2. Get Comic by Name
GET http://localhost:3000/api/comics?q=Yolo

###

# 3. Get all comics

GET http://localhost:3000/api/comics

###

# 4. Update a comic

PUT http://localhost:3000/api/comics/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Yolo2",
    "chapter": 2,
    "page": 1
}

###

# 4.1 Update a comic with link

PUT http://localhost:3000/api/comics/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Yolo2",
    "chapter": 2,
    "page": 1,
    "link": "https://example.com"
}

###

# 5. Delete a comic by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/comics/1
